* A banking application stores daily account balances in an array. How would you identify the largest increase between two consecutive days?
* A stock-trading application stores daily stock prices. How would you calculate the maximum profit from one buy-and-sell transaction?
* An analytics service receives millions of integers. How would you identify duplicates while minimizing time and memory usage?
* A logistics application stores delivery distances in an array. How would you find two locations whose combined distance equals a target?
* A reporting system stores monthly revenue figures. How would you identify the continuous period with the highest total revenue?
