* A financial reconciliation system compares two arrays of transaction IDs. How would you efficiently find missing and unexpected transactions?
* A data pipeline needs to rotate a large array by a specified number of positions. How would you perform the operation in place?
* A monitoring system needs the maximum value in every sliding window of size K. How would you design an efficient solution?
